package lattice:plugin-host@0.1.0;

/// Mirrors the `Mode` trait method set + `ModeRegistry` (lattice-mode). The
/// guest declares a mode; the host registers `Arc<dyn DynMode>`; keymap
/// contributions land at `KeymapLayer::MinorMode(id)` only (the
/// `KeymapCapability` write-gate). PH7.11 lands the declaration WIT +
/// registration path; bundled modes-as-components are Phase 8.
interface modes {}
